  "releaseNotes": "Enhance ClassHelper with member retrieval methods\nExpanded the `ClassHelper` class in `ClassHelper.cs` to include new methods for retrieving static and instance members (methods, properties, and fields) of specified types. Added error handling that throws an `ArgumentException` if a member is not found. Updated method names for clarity and added new methods: `GetStaticProperties`, `GetInstanceProperties`, `GetStaticFields`, `GetInstanceFields`, `GetStaticMethods`, and `GetInstanceMethods`. Localized error messages to Chinese for improved user feedback.",
